Handlers.TriggerHandlerDates::VNRevivalRuHaiku_Resolve(System.String,System.Int32,System.String)@62", "evaluationTargetSha256": "bf7c57f448be48b9017ec6bb4bb67dccce963238286fb5ab541c6f9ca9f97194", "slot": 2, "authorScansion": ["be", "bar", "ma", "rā", "bar", "abr", "hā"], "syllables": 7, "changed": false, "independentAcceptance": false}, {"id": "ds:303:327:Dialogue Text", "source": "To unite our friends", "sourceSha256": "1e88cd471eda141a400327ba4506609d25f3c8a0f295d06f9ac75bee758cc175", "target": "تا یاران جمع شن", "targetSha256": "e5051247092712cd83df7d5530d8e30b93b30a43df923262afa6240e4b4eafe3", "evaluationId": "managed:Managed/Assembly-CSharp.dll:System.String TheForestOfLove.Events.TriggerHandlers.TriggerHandlerDates::VNRevivalRuHaiku_Resolve(System.String,System.Int32,System.String)@72", "evaluationTargetSha256": "e5051247092712cd83df7d5530d8e30b93b30a43df923262afa6240e4b4eafe3", "slot": 3, "authorScansion": ["tā", "yā", "rān", "jam", "shan"], "syllables": 5, "changed": false, "independentAcceptance": false}, {"id": "ds:303:412:Dialogue Text", "source": "Why must you work now?", "sourceSha256": "8d1eb87ec6a132ee29104614ad1730cb3e7cdb9274b611a70f8f2311756e6de2", "target": "چرا حالا کار؟", "targetSha256": "6f173d37f38d44f29b0457046b81cd440d8ff5a28babd5feaa2f3a30504ad3ab", "evaluationId": "managed:Managed/Assembly-CSharp.dll:System.String TheForestOfLove.Events.TriggerHandlers.TriggerHandlerDates::VNRevivalRuHaiku_Resolve(System.String,System.Int32,System.String)@82", "evaluationTargetSha256": "6f173d37f38d44f29b0457046b81cd440d8ff5a28babd5feaa2f3a30504ad3ab", "slot": 3, "authorScansion": ["che", "rā", "hā", "lā", "kār"], "syllables": 5, "changed": false, "independentAcceptance": false}, {"id": "ds:303:408:Dialogue Text", "source": "Where no one has gone", "sourceSha256": "eda7b86bbf966e1d9c18727b5a13fd1963e98dd79aa642de355e51fd4e3d2156", "target": "کسی نرفته", "targetSha256": "16604d89047eb7acbec1528d63058e8249370acbe92ef4a4074798598294d014", "evaluationId": "managed:Managed/Assembly-CSharp.dll:System.String TheForestOfLove.Events.TriggerHandlers.TriggerHandlerDates::VNRevivalRuHaiku_Resolve(System.String,System.Int32,System.String)@92", "evaluationTargetSha256": "16604d89047eb7acbec1528d63058e8249370acbe92ef4a4074798598294d014", "slot": 3, "authorScansion": ["ka", "si", "na", "raf", "te"], "syllables": 5, "changed": false, "independentAcceptance": false}], "reading": "The noun حشره is ha/sha/re in full. ریز is riz; چُست is čost, one syllable. The semicolon introduces two apposed, separately punctuated predicates; no ezafe or conjunction is pronounced between them. No hidden vowel deletion, new species or newly coined stem.", "sourceFacts": {"insect": "حشره", "small": "ریز", "busy": "چُست: briskly active; author literary inference, independently pending"}, "meaning": "An insect, tiny, briskly active. The short nominal tableau keeps the busy insect image while its work/priorities/leisure commentary retains the original later choices and feedback.", "independentAcceptance": false, "native": "not-run", "empiricalPronunciationTest": "not-run", "lexicalEvidence": {"path": "localization/case-decisions/six-next-locales-20261102-01/fa/repair-02/lexical-evidence.json", "sha256": "4e086b4b9d6a8b15314d220adbfdd91853a535bad44f0b8372711ae6da3c8bf1"}}}
{"id": "author:lexical-research-and-limits", "document": {"kind": "dictionary-research-not-external-translation", "selected": "چُست", "pronunciation": "čost", "sources": [{"title": "Amid / Ghorbanzadeh dictionary: چست", "url": "https://vajehyab.com/amid/%DA%86%D8%B3%D8%AA", "pronunciation": "/čost/", "excerpt": "چابک؛ چالاک؛ جلد", "observation": "An established adjective for brisk/nimble activity; not an insect noun or species."}, {"title": "Dehkhoda dictionary: چست", "url": "https://vajehyab.com/dehkhoda/%DA%86%D8%B3%D8%AA-2?q=sj", "excerpt": "زبر و زرنگ (مقابل کاهل و سست)", "observation": "The dictionary opposes this active/brisk sense to laziness or sluggishness. Search-result entry retrieved; direct reopen cache miss, not fabricated fetch success."}], "rejectedRoutes": [{"route": "hash/re", "reason": "Retains the independently rejected unsupported vowel deletion."}, {"route": "خزک", "url": "https://vajehyab.com/dehkhoda/%D8%AE%D8%B2%DA%A9", "reason": "The dictionary defines a small creeping creature, not unambiguously a generic insect; avoid an obscure replacement noun and added creeping restriction."}, {"route": "حشرک", "reason": "Bounded search supplied no reliable established Persian insect entry; no coined stem adopted."}], "authorInference": "In this insect tableau čost conveys brisk busy activity, rather than a new anatomical ability. This is contextual literary judgment, not a dictionary claim that every use of busy means čost. Independent semantic/native judgment of this exact fit remains required.", "accessedDate": "2026-11-03"}}
